#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
Music Lyrics Bridge
QQ Music backend connects via Chrome DevTools Protocol and extracts playback
info; MoeKoeMusic backend connects via its built-in WebSocket API. Fetches
synced lyrics from lrclib.net / Netease / the player itself, and writes the
current lyric line to /tmp/lyrics-current.txt for a plasmoid to display.

Usage:
  ./qqmusic-lyrics-bridge [--debug-port PORT]
  ./qqmusic-lyrics-bridge [--moekoe-port PORT]
  (player is selected in the plasmoid's Configure dialog)
"""

